[v8 152.2.0]     support may need to disable this as well, though they may need to replace
[v8 152.2.0]     code with C/C++ to get a functional product.
[v8 152.2.0]    
[v8 152.2.0]     Based on the above:
[v8 152.2.0]    
[v8 152.2.0]     * `enable_rust` may be consulted under `//build` and `//testing` directories
[v8 152.2.0]       (which may be used outside of Chromium build)
[v8 152.2.0]     * `enable_rust` should *not* be consulted in other Chromium directories
[v8 152.2.0]       (including `//base`, `//net`, etc.)
[v8 152.2.0] 
